# The index is 226 MB and is not carried here. It lives on the Hub as a dataset,
# and `scripts/fetch_index.py` pulls it; `scripts/prepare_space.py` stages it for
# the Space. Keeping it out means the repository clones in seconds.
build/
.cache/
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
*.build-hash

# Thesis and defence material. The writing is the author's own and stays off the
# public repository; what ships here is the system that the writing is about.
docs/teza/
docs/mbrojtja/

# Authoring tooling for the thesis and the defence deck. These build the documents
# above and carry their front matter, the supervisor's name and the deck's text, so
# they stay off the public repository for the same reason the documents do. Nothing
# in the system imports them.
scripts/build_teza.py
scripts/build_teza_docx.py
scripts/build_slides.py

# The author's own research writing: the thesis plan and the dated findings log
# that the methodology chapter cites. They stay on disk, not on the repository.
docs/PLAN.md
docs/FINDINGS.md
